      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The lich is a 14th-level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Intelligence (spell save DC 18, +10 to hit with spell attacks). The lich has the following death knight and mage spells prepared: Cantrips (at will): <em>chill touch, sapping sting, frostbite, flurry, prestidigitation</em> 1st level (4 slots): <em>cause fear, ✦ corpse explosion, ✦ drain life, false life</em> 2nd level (3 slots): <em>blindness/deafness, crown of madness, ray of enfeeblement</em> 3rd level (3 slot): <em>animate dead, ✦ asphyxiate, ✦ blizzard, counterspell, speak with dead, summon undead</em> 4th level (3 slot): <em>✦ ice block, ✦ death and decay, blight</em> 5th level (2 slot): <em>✦ army of the Dead, cone of cold, danse macabre, enervation</em> 6th level (1 slot): <em>circle of death, create undead, investiture of ice, wall of ice 7th level (1 slot): </em>finger of death, ✦ glacial spike*</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
